243
00:16:26,680 --> 00:16:28,400
Teng Huayuan...

244
00:16:29,400 --> 00:16:32,280
Since you like those 9 Nascent Soul so much,

245
00:16:32,980 --> 00:16:34,320
I will kill them

246
00:16:35,280 --> 00:16:37,080
